    "The crew rolls out of Saratoga together. Thirteen miles in, Hicks Road brings you to Guadalupe Rock. From there, the loop opens up along McKean and G8 before swinging through Morgan Hill. Metcalf saves a winding stretch for the return leg. By the time Saratoga comes back into view, you’ll have put 83 miles on the clock.",
